    "summary": "Customer (Plus) reports wrong item on order Q-7901: received chicken tikka masala instead of paneer tikka masala ($15.50); she is vegetarian. Handoff in person at 18:50, within the reporting window. Profile shows refunds_last_30d = 3, so no refund or credit was issued per policy. Needs specialist review and follow-up."
